---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Serve Locally | Pine Lake Covenant Church"
  description="Ways to serve the Sammamish and Issaquah area alongside local organizations Pine Lake partners with."
>
  <article class="page">
    <header class="page__header">
      <h1>Serve Locally</h1>
      <p class="page__subhead">Making a difference close to home</p>

      <p class="page__lede">
        If you’re looking for a way to help nearby, you don’t need to invent something new. We partner with local
        organizations we trust and join them with time, relationships, and practical help. For a lot of people, serving
        becomes a way to build community while contributing to something larger.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Who we partner with</h2>

      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Issaquah Food &amp; Clothing Bank</h3>
          <p>Helping stock shelves and serve neighbors facing food insecurity across the Issaquah area.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Bright Bridge</h3>
          <p>Supporting families in the region with practical help in moments of acute need.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Echo Glen</h3>
          <p>Showing up for young people at the Echo Glen Children’s Center through ongoing relationships.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h3>Young Life</h3>
          <p>Coming alongside local students, including Young Life Capernaum for students with disabilities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Getting started</h2>

      <p>
        You don’t need experience or a long-term commitment to begin — most people start by showing up once with
        someone who’s already involved.
      </p>

      <p>
        To find a good first step, email <a href="mailto:office@plcc.org">office@plcc.org</a> or call
        <a href="tel:+14253928636">(425) 392-8636</a>, and we’ll point you toward what’s coming up.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}for-our-neighbors/`}>Back to For Our Neighbors</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
